## QA follow-ups

- **Blank To Dos / Documents (2026-08-20):** Restored `ResizableMarkdownImage` import in `MarkdownEditor.tsx`. It was dropped when wiring `isAllowedHref`, which threw `ReferenceError` on any page that mounts the editor (project To Dos, Documents, and other Markdown surfaces).
- **Paste HTML still visible (2026-08-20):** API only stripped on save. Editor now sanitizes on paste, on load, and on each markdown emit (same rules as the API). Autolinks `<https://…>` are preserved.
- **Idea titles still allowed `<script>` (2026-08-20):** Plain-text titles/names now strip HTML in the UI as you type and on API write (`plainTitle`). Same for documents, tasks, projects, wiki, boards, and related name fields.
- **All fields including Add tag (2026-08-20):** Global DOM input sanitizer plus API middleware so every text/query/JSON string is stripped (passwords excluded). Tag create/attach names included.
